      "text": "真实扩展注册\n\n# L2 adapter · config.py / factory.py\nregister_l2_adapter_type(\"fs\", FSL2AdapterConfig)\nregister_l2_adapter_factory(\"fs\", _create_fs_adapter)\n\n# Transfer channel\nregister_transfer_channel_factory(\"nixl\", create_nixl_context)\n\n# Policies\nregister_store_policy(\"default\", DefaultStorePolicy)\nregister_prefetch_policy(\"default\", DefaultPrefetchPolicy)\n\n# Build profiles\nsetup_extensions.policy discovers BuildProfile subclasses with pkgutil", "originalText": "真实扩展注册\n\n# L2 adapter · config.py / factory.py\nregister_l2_adapter_type(\"fs\", FSL2AdapterConfig)\nregister_l2_adapter_factory(\"fs\", _create_fs_adapter)\n\n# Transfer channel\nregister_transfer_channel_factory(\"nixl\", create_nixl_context)\n\n# Policies\nregister_store_policy(\"default\", DefaultStorePolicy)\nregister_prefetch_policy(\"default\", DefaultPrefetchPolicy)\n\n# Build profiles\nsetup_extensions.policy discovers BuildProfile subclasses with pkgutil",
